The `StreamingMarkdownBuffer` type, its `ParseState`, the `INLINE_TOKEN_RE`
tokenizer regex, and the `find_safe_end` / `process_line_start` /
`check_code_fence` / `process_inline_token` scan logic in
`src/transcript/markdown.rs` are adapted from Goose's
`MarkdownBuffer` (same commit/file above) to satisfy canon atom
